{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1935489036"}, "name":{"label":"One_plate.momos"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-21T03:10:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.38"}, "id":{"label":"14208529165"}, "title":{"label":"IMPOSTER WHO?"}, "content":{"label":"Imposter Who? is a fun and exciting social deduction game where players try to figure out who the imposter is while completing different tasks and answering questions. The game is easy to learn, making it great for playing with friends and family.\nWhat makes the game enjoyable is the suspense and the funny moments that happen when players accuse each other. Every round feels different because the imposter changes, so the game stays interesting and unpredictable. It also helps improve observation, communication, and critical thinking skills.\nHowever, the game can sometimes become chaotic if too many people talk at once, and some rounds may end quickly if the imposter is discovered early.\nOverall, Imposter Who? is entertaining, interactive, and perfect for group gatherings. I would rate it 4.5/5 stars and recommend it to anyone who enjoys mystery and teamwork games.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6746781192&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
